---
---

<section class="manifesto surface-dark" aria-labelledby="manifesto-heading">
  <div class="container manifesto__inner">
    <div class="manifesto__label-col">
      <p class="manifesto__eyebrow">01 / Strategic Perspective</p>
      <span class="manifesto__pill">Indonesia → Global</span>
    </div>

    <div class="manifesto__body-col">
      <h2 id="manifesto-heading" class="manifesto__statement" data-scrub-chars>
        Strategy should do more than win a pitch — it should move Indonesian enterprises into international markets.
      </h2>

      <div class="manifesto__columns" data-reveal="up">
        <div class="manifesto__column">
          <h3 class="manifesto__sub">Commercial Rigor</h3>
          <p class="manifesto__copy">
            From SME export roadmaps to Gen Z brand architecture, every recommendation starts with field evidence, margin discipline, and consumer behavior rather than generic frameworks.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="manifesto__column">
          <h3 class="manifesto__sub">Execution Under Scale</h3>
          <p class="manifesto__copy">
            Whether leading 40-person project committees or representing Indonesia in Singapore national finals, alignment turns ambitious ideas into measurable outcomes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    background-color: var(--bg-dark);
    color: var(--ink-light);
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 8.5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline-dark);
  }

  .manifesto__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 18rem) 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .manifesto__label-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 2rem;
  }

  .manifesto__eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  .manifesto__pill {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background-color: var(--color-scarlet);
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .manifesto__body-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .manifesto__statement {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.95rem, 3.8vw, 3.65rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--ink-light);
    max-width: 24ch;
  }

  .manifesto__columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline-dark);
  }

  .manifesto__column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .manifesto__sub {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  .manifesto__copy {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .manifesto__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }

    .manifesto__label-col {
      position: static;
    }

    .manifesto__columns {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
  }
</style>
